 "blockers": [],
 "notes": [
  "search-content returns hit titles and prefaces containing <strong> highlight tags. Hit 'url' is a site path such as /befolkning/folketall/statistikk/befolkning: split it into subject/area/slug for get-statistic, or into subject/area/artikler/slug for get-article.",
  "Facet values for search-content filters come from the 'subjects' and 'contentTypes' arrays in its response.",
  "Statbank workflow: search-tables, then get-table-metadata (variable codes and value codes), then get-table-data with valueCodes. Data and metadata are json-stat2: values are a flat array ordered by the 'id'/'size' dimensions.",
  "get-table-data's time/region/contents params map to valueCodes[Tid], valueCodes[Region] and valueCodes[ContentsCode], which most SSB tables use. Check get-table-metadata for the real variable codes. Mandatory variables you omit may cause an error, so give all mandatory variables or none (none returns the default selection).",
  "PxWebApi has rate and size limits (the data cell limit is about 800,000 cells). Statbank updates daily at 08:00 Norwegian time. Data is licensed CC BY 4.0.",
  "Klass returns XML unless asked for JSON. The command sends Accept: application/json.",
  "Not captured: the name search (navnes\u00f8k) and the CSV/xlsx table downloads on statistic pages."
 ],
